# Line endings.
#
# The telemetry golden fixtures are compared byte for byte against a string a
# generator builds with `\n` (`pipe::tests::golden`), and the Node oracle in
# `crates/offline-protocol/tests/tools/` reads the same files. A Windows
# checkout under the default `core.autocrlf=true` rewrites them to CRLF, and
# the comparison then fails on every line for a reason that has nothing to do
# with the pipe. Pin JSON to LF so the bytes on disk are the bytes the test
# generates on every platform.
*.json text eol=lf
